  "deprecatedMatches": {},
  "qid": "237",
  "tip": "<p>Start by mapping requirements to the database model. If you see <i>relational schema</i> plus <i>global consistency</i> and <i>multi region</i> scale with low latency transactions, prefer Spanner. If you need relational but mostly single region, consider Cloud SQL. If the workload is document oriented or wide column, evaluate Firestore or Bigtable.</p>",
